# Output Visualizations

## Default Rate by Credit Score Band
Shows the observed loan default rate across borrower credit-score bands. The chart highlights how default risk varies by borrower credit quality and helps identify higher-risk credit segments.

## Default Rate by DTI Band

Compares observed default rates across low-, medium-, and high-debt-to-income borrower groups. The visualization is used to assess whether borrower leverage is associated with elevated credit risk.

## Default Rate by Loan Purpose

Compares observed default rates across different loan-purpose categories. The chart helps identify lending products associated with relatively higher portfolio default risk.

